@startuml
title Foot365 System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Football Enthusiast" as Fan
actor "Chatbot User" as ChatUser
actor "Reminder Requester" as ReminderUser

cloud "AWS Cloud" {
  package "Frontend" {
    component "Foot365 Web Application\nHTML/CSS/Bootstrap/jQuery" as WebApp
    component "Amazon S3\nStatic hosting / file storage" as S3
  }

  package "Security" {
    component "Amazon Cognito" as Cognito
    component "AWS IAM" as IAM
  }

  package "API & Backend" {
    component "Amazon API Gateway\nHTTP API / execute-api /\nSigV4 / JSON defaults" as APIGW
    component "AWS Lambda Backend\nPython / Node" as Lambda
    component "Chatbot Recommendation Endpoint\nConversation Handler\n(fixtures, results, screening locations)" as Chatbot
  }

  package "Data" {
    database "Amazon DynamoDB\nMatch results, statistics, fixtures" as DynamoDB
    database "Elasticsearch\nMatch data retrieval/search" as Elasticsearch
  }

  package "Prediction" {
    component "Amazon SageMaker\nMatch prediction" as SageMaker
  }

  package "Notification" {
    queue "Amazon SQS\nReminder queue" as SQS
    component "Amazon SNS\nSMS delivery" as SNS
  }

  package "Streaming" {
    node "Amazon EC2" {
      component "Kafka + Apache Avro\nLive score pipeline" as Kafka
    }
  }

  package "External Interfaces" {
    component "Live Score Event Source" as ScoreSource
    component "SMS Network" as SMS
  }
}

Fan --> WebApp : view fixtures, standings,\nschedules, results, live scores
ChatUser --> WebApp : chatbot messages
ReminderUser --> WebApp : request reminders

WebApp --> S3 : hosted on / static assets
WebApp --> APIGW : HTTP API requests\nJSON + SigV4 execute-api
APIGW --> Lambda : routes/invokes backend
Lambda --> Chatbot : recommendation endpoint /\nconversation handling
Lambda --> Cognito : authentication
Lambda --> IAM : protected access / security
Lambda --> DynamoDB : persist/retrieve match data
DynamoDB --> Elasticsearch : connect for retrieval
Lambda --> Elasticsearch : retrieval/search queries
Lambda --> SageMaker : match prediction generation
Lambda --> SQS : queue reminder request
SQS --> SNS : queued reminder handling
SNS --> SMS : SMS reminder delivery
SMS --> ReminderUser : SMS reminder

ScoreSource --> Kafka : live score events\nAvro encoded
Kafka ..> Lambda : updated live score stream [inferred]
Kafka ..> DynamoDB : live score updates [inferred]
Kafka ..> Elasticsearch : live score indexing [inferred]

note right of APIGW
  Explicit API requirements:
  HTTP verb, path, query params,
  headers, body; JSON defaults;
  AWS Signature V4 with execute-api.
end note

note bottom of Kafka
  Explicit streaming requirements:
  Kafka with Apache Avro on EC2;
  real-time live score update processing.
end note

legend right
  Solid arrow = explicitly specified interaction
  Dashed arrow = inferred / design-level relationship
end legend

@enduml
